    "name": "GRAND HOSTEL LDK SAPPORO",
    "detail": "loved this hostel ! had great facilities including two sitting rooms, a big kitchen and laundry facilities. our double room was very small but thats what you get in japan! we did have to ask for another blanket as we were there over new years but they were only too happy to oblige. the location is great! its about a 10 minute walk into Susukino, a major nightlife district in Sapporo. the staff are fantastic! we were there over new years and they put on a great party on new years eve. they also did a number of other parties including a sushi party which was great to meet other people. the staff are extremely knowledgeable and helpful and gave us many reccomendations for restaurants in the area. the bathrooms are private on each floor (shared, but pod style) and you can lock the door. they are spotless ! highly reccomend! ",
